{"id":"665163","name":"苦瓜炒蛋","author":"美食家3998N_bkoa","authorId":"13061039","desc":"","cover":"images/665163/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"苦瓜","amount":"1根"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"将苦瓜洗净挖去籽备用。","img":"images/665163/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切成小片备用。","img":"images/665163/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放在盘子里面备用。","img":"images/665163/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅里烧开水加盐少许。","img":"images/665163/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入苦瓜焯水2分钟后捞出来放盘子里备用。","img":"images/665163/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"个鸡蛋打在碗中搅散放入盐调味。","img":"images/665163/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"锅里放油热后倒入蛋液等定型后装盘备用。","img":"images/665163/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"另起锅/烧油倒入苦瓜片鸡蛋倒入一起翻炒。","img":"images/665163/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入少许盐调味出锅。","img":"images/665163/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/665163/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}